  "description": "Relive the Bubble vibe with “Bubble Outline”!\nBubble Outline is a cheerful, hand-drawn display font that perfectly captures the “True Cartoon Spirit” with a modern, graffiti-like touch. Featuring bold, clean outlines and playful silhouettes, this font is designed to give your projects a fun and inspired look in the upcoming year that stands out!\nPerfect Font for Coloring & Crafting!\nWith its hollow center and smooth edges, Bubble Outline is an excellent choice for creating coloring books and worksheets. This font is also very “cut-friendly” for crafters using vinyl presses.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Relive the Bubble vibe with “Bubble Outline”!</p>\n<p>Bubble Outline is a cheerful, hand-drawn display font that perfectly captures the “True Cartoon Spirit” with a modern, graffiti-like touch. Featuring bold, clean outlines and playful silhouettes, this font is designed to give your projects a fun and inspired look in the upcoming year that stands out!<br>\nPerfect Font for Coloring &amp; Crafting!</p>\n<p>With its hollow center and smooth edges, Bubble Outline is an excellent choice for creating coloring books and worksheets. This font is also very “cut-friendly” for crafters using vinyl presses.</p>",
